('9g3-w9-supplement-graph-5',$question_json${"id":"9g3-w9-supplement-graph-5","type":"MCQ","exam":"9th week practice","examWeek":9,"classroom":"9G3","topic":"Linear functions","prompt":"Which equation in slope-intercept form represents the graphed line?","promptAr":"أي معادلة بصيغة الميل والمقطع تمثل المستقيم المرسوم؟","answer":"The slope is $m=\\frac{3}{7}$ and the y-intercept is $b=-4$, so $y=\\frac{3}{7}x-4$.","answerAr":"الإجابة الصحيحة: $y=\\frac{3}{7}x-4$. نكتب المعادلة على الصورة $y=mx+b$؛ m هو الميل وb التقاطع مع محور الصادات.","difficulty":"Standard","marks":1,"diagram":"none","image":"","options":["$y=\\frac{3}{7}x+4$","$y=\\frac{3}{7}x-4$","$y=-4x+\\frac{3}{7}$","$y=-\\frac{3}{7}x-4$"],"optionsAr":["$y=\\frac{3}{7}x+4$","$y=\\frac{3}{7}x-4$","$y=-4x+\\frac{3}{7}$","$y=-\\frac{3}{7}x-4$"],"correctIndex":1,"sourceQuestion":5,"linearEquationChoices":{"target":[0.42857142857142855,-4],"choices":[[0.42857142857142855,4],[0.42857142857142855,-4],[-4,0.42857142857142855],[-0.42857142857142855,-4]]},"linearGraph":{"coefficients":[0.42857142857142855,-4],"bounds":[-10,10,-10,10]},"sourceReference":"Supplementary graph matching exercise supplied by teacher (page unspecified)"}$question_json$::jsonb),
